# ==============================================================================
# EarlyAI ATS — Frontend Environment Configuration (apps/web)
# ==============================================================================
# This file documents all frontend environment variables supported by Vite.
# Duplicate this file as .env.local for local development.
# In Vercel, configure these variables in:
# Project Settings > Environment Variables.
#
# IMPORTANT SECURITY RULES:
# - NEVER put backend secrets (JWT_SECRET, MONGODB_URI, R2 keys, API keys) here!
# - Only variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to the browser bundle.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# API Base URL (Required for Hosted Deployments on Vercel)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# In local development:
# - Leave blank to use Vite's internal reverse proxy (/api -> http://localhost:5000), OR
# - Set to: http://localhost:5000/api/v1
#
# In Vercel (Staging / Production):
# - Set to your deployed Render backend URL.
# - Both formats are automatically normalized by src/api/baseUrl.ts:
#   * Origin only: https://earlyhire-ats-api-staging.onrender.com
#   * With path:   https://earlyhire-ats-api-staging.onrender.com/api/v1
# - DO NOT point to localhost in Vercel settings!
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
VITE_API_URL=https://earlyhire-ats-api-staging.onrender.com/api/v1
